        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    taxable_income = 82_000\n    tax_brackets = [\n        (10_000, 0.10),\n        (30_000, 0.20),\n        (60_000, 0.30),\n        (float(\"inf\"), 0.40),\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_tax = 0\n    previous_limit = 0\n    for upper_limit, rate in tax_brackets:\n        income_in_bracket = max(0, min(taxable_income, upper_limit) - previous_limit)\n        total_tax += income_in_bracket * rate\n        previous_limit = upper_limit\n        if taxable_income <= upper_limit:\n            break\n\n    # Return answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(total_tax)\n```",
